label n_G01:
    $ node = "G01"
    scene roof with fade
    show hana neutral at far_left with dissolve
    show mira neutral at left with dissolve
    show leila neutral at right with dissolve
    show tessa neutral at far_right with dissolve
    checkpoint
    narrator "All four women have independently said they want to try this shared relationship. Tonight is for making that choice practical. Hana wants dependable one-on-one time."
    narrator "Mira wants jealousy named instead of disguised as teasing. Leila needs long-distance plans that do not leave her out. Tessa wants rest and honest limits."
    narrator "None is agreeing to compete for scraps of attention."
    talk with hana, mira, leila, tessa:
        goal: Can the five of you agree on a relationship that gives everyone care, freedom, and an equal voice? Staging note, used only if the player has clearly welcomed romance and nothing blocks it: After the agreement, each woman asks about affection in her own way: Hana offers her hand, Mira asks for a kiss without a dare, Leila invites an embrace, and Tessa makes space on the sofa. A shared blanket and four individual goodnight kisses are possible if everyone welcomes them. Do not imply that the women must date or kiss each other.
        commit: ask
        max_turns: 18
        on_end: leave
        outcome together "Five people, one honest beginning":
            rule: Discuss and explicitly accept honest communication, individual dates, no ranking of partners, consent for each affectionate act, and anyone being free to renegotiate or leave. All four have already independently opted in.
            $ flags.everyone_agreed = true
            $ flags.g01_done = true
            jump hub
        outcome slow "More time, without pressure":
            rule: Ask to keep dating slowly rather than finalize the shared relationship. No everyone ending yet.
            $ flags.group_slow = true
            $ flags.g01_done = true
            jump hub
        outcome leave "A conversation to finish another day":
            rule: Leave without an agreement; no collective commitment is assumed.
            $ flags.g01_done = true
            jump hub

